node-proc-mcq-001.example:
```js
function failGracefully(reason) {
  console.error('error:', reason);
  // ✅ Lets pending output flush, then exits with code 1 when the loop drains.
  process.exitCode = 1;
  // ❌ process.exit(1) here could truncate the console.error above.
}
failGracefully('bad input');
console.log('this still runs and flushes before exit');
```
